Third-party code vendored in llama.cpp and compiled into llama-server and its libraries

llama.cpp vendors the libraries below in its vendor/ directory (checked at tag b8640, commit
7992aa7c8e21ea2eb7a5e4802da56eec7b376036, https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/tree/b8640/vendor).
llama.cpp's own licence is in llama.cpp.LICENSE. Each library is used unmodified, under the
licence that follows.

  cpp-httplib (vendor/cpp-httplib)        MIT                        HTTP server in llama-server
  nlohmann/json (vendor/nlohmann)         MIT                        JSON in llama-server and common
  stb_image (vendor/stb)                  MIT (or public domain)     image decoding in libmtmd
  miniaudio (vendor/miniaudio)            MIT-0 (or public domain)   audio decoding in libmtmd
  subprocess.h (vendor/sheredom)          Unlicense (public domain)  process helper

